<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Jadoo - Viva e aproveite uma nova vida intensa</title>
    
    <!-- CSS External Libraries -->
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Volkhov:wght@700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">

    <style>
        /* --- Variáveis Globais & Reset --- */
        :root {
            --primary-color: #DF6951;
            --secondary-color: #F1A501;
            --heading-color: #14183E;
            --text-color: #5E6282;
            --bg-light: #FFF;
            --font-main: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
            --font-heading: 'Volkhov', serif;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            font-family: var(--font-main);
            color: var(--text-color);
            background-color: var(--bg-light);
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
        }

        ul {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 0;
        }

        /* --- Estilos Reutilizáveis --- */
        .container-custom {
            max-width: 1140px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        .subtitle {
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--primary-color);
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .title {
            font-family: var(--font-heading);
            font-size: 40px;
            color: var(--heading-color);
            text-transform: capitalize;
            line-height: 1.2;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .section-padding {
            padding: 60px 0;
        }

        /* --- Header & Navegação --- */
        header {
            padding: 20px 0;
        }

        .navbar-brand.logo, .footer-logo {
            font-family: var(--font-heading);
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 32px;
            color: var(--heading-color) !important;
        }

        .nav-link-custom {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #212832 !important;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .nav-link-custom:hover {
            color: var(--primary-color) !important;
        }

        .btn-signup {
            border: 1px solid #212832;
            padding: 8px 20px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            color: #212832 !important;
        }

        .btn-signup:hover {
            background: #212832;
            color: #FFF !important;
        }

        .lang-select {
            border: none;
            background: transparent;
            font: inherit;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: #212832;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        /* --- Hero Section --- */
        .hero {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 40px;
            padding: 40px 0 80px;
        }

        .hero-content {
            flex: 1;
            max-width: 550px;
        }

        .hero-title {
            font-family: var(--font-heading);
            font-size: 64px;
            line-height: 1.15;
            color: var(--heading-color);
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .hero-desc {
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .hero-btns {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .btn-primary-custom {
            background: var(--secondary-color);
            color: #FFF;
            padding: 16px 28px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-weight: 500;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(241, 165, 1, 0.2);
            transition: background 0.3s ease;
        }

        .btn-primary-custom:hover {
            background: #d99400;
            color: #FFF;
        }

        .play-btn {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 15px;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: #686D77;
        }

        .play-icon {
            width: 48px;
            height: 48px;
            background: var(--primary-color);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: #FFF;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(223, 105, 81, 0.3);
            padding-left: 3px;
        }

        .hero-image {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: flex-end;
        }

        .hero-image img {
            max-width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            border-radius: 20px;
        }

        /* --- Categorias & Serviços --- */
        .categories {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .grid-categories {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .category-card {
            padding: 35px 25px;
            border-radius: 24px;
            background: #FFF;
            border: 1px solid #F0F0F0;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .category-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }

        .category-icon {
            height: 70px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .category-icon img {
            max-height: 100%;
        }

        .category-card h3 {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: var(--heading-color);
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .category-card p {
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        /* --- Destinos --- */
        .destinations {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .grid-destinations {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .dest-card {
            border-radius: 20px;
            overflow: hidden;
            background: #FFF;
            border: 1px solid #F0F0F0;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
        }

        .dest-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
        }

        .dest-img {
            height: 300px;
            width: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .dest-info {
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .dest-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--heading-color);
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .dest-duration {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--text-color);
        }

        /* --- Reservas --- */
        .booking {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 50px;
        }

        .booking-content {
            flex: 1;
        }

        .steps-list {
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .step-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .step-img {
            width: 44px;
            height: 44px;
            object-fit: contain;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .step-text h4 {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--heading-color);
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .step-text p {
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .booking-card-wrapper {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .trip-card {
            background: #FFF;
            padding: 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            max-width: 350px;
            width: 100%;
            border: 1px solid #F0F0F0;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }

        .trip-img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 320px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        /* --- Parceiros --- */
        .partners {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .imagem-parceiros {
            max-width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            filter: grayscale(100%);
            opacity: 0.6;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .imagem-parceiros:hover {
            filter: grayscale(0%);
            opacity: 1;
        }

        /* --- Depoimentos --- */
        .testimonials {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 50px;
        }

        .testimonials-content {
            flex: 1;
            max-width: 450px;
        }

        .dots-navigation {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .dot {
            width: 10px;
            height: 10px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #E5E5E5;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background 0.3s ease;
        }

        .dot.active {
            background: var(--heading-color);
        }

        .testimonials-card-wrapper {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: flex-end;
        }

        .testimonial-card {
            background: #FFF;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 30px;
            position: relative;
            max-width: 480px;
            width: 100%;
            border: 1px solid #F0F0F0;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
        }

        .testimonial-avatar {
            width: 60px;
            height: 60px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            object-fit: cover;
            position: absolute;
            top: -30px;
            left: -30px;
            border: 3px solid #FFF;
        }

        .testimonial-text {
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .testimonial-author {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--heading-color);
            margin-bottom: 2px;
        }

        .testimonial-location {
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        /* --- Inscrição --- */
        .subscribe-box {
            background: rgba(223, 215, 249, 0.25);
            border-radius: 80px 20px 20px 20px;
            padding: 60px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .subscribe-title {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--heading-color);
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto 30px;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        .subscribe-form {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 16px;
            max-width: 550px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .input-group-custom {
            position: relative;
            flex: 1;
        }

        .input-group-custom i {
            position: absolute;
            left: 20px;
            top: 50%;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            color: var(--text-color);
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        .subscribe-input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 16px 20px 16px 50px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            border: 1px solid transparent;
            outline: none;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .subscribe-btn {
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FF946D 0%, #FF7D68 100%);
            color: #FFF;
            border: none;
            padding: 16px 36px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
        }

        .subscribe-btn:hover {
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        /* --- Rodapé --- */
        footer {
            padding-top: 60px;
            padding-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .footer-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 2fr repeat(3, 1fr) 1.5fr;
            gap: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
        }

        .footer-desc {
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.5;
            max-width: 200px;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .footer-col h4 {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #080809;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .footer-col ul li {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .footer-col ul li a {
            font-size: 15px;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .footer-col ul li a:hover {
            color: var(--primary-color);
        }

        .social-btns {
            display: flex;
            gap: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .social-btn {
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #FFF;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: #080809;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .social-btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }

        .social-btn.active {
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #B8D2CE 0%, #C2ACE3 100%);
            color: #FFF;
        }

        .app-download p {
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 500;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .app-stores {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .btn-store {
            background: #000;
            color: #FFF;
            border: none;
            padding: 8px 14px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 12px;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
        }

        .footer-copyright {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 500;
            border-top: 1px solid #F0F0F0;
            padding-top: 20px;
        }

        /* --- Media Queries (Responsividade) --- */
        @media (max-width: 992px) {
            .hero, .booking, .testimonials {
                flex-direction: column;
                text-align: center;
            }

            .hero-content {
                max-width: 100%;
            }

            .hero-title {
                font-size: 48px;
            }

            .hero-btns, .dots-navigation, .testimonials-card-wrapper {
                justify-content: center;
            }

            .testimonials-card-wrapper {
                margin-top: 40px;
            }

            .testimonial-avatar {
                left: 50%;
                transform: translateX(-50%);
            }

            .footer-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 576px) {
            .hero-title {
                font-size: 36px;
            }

            .subscribe-form {
                flex-direction: column;
            }

            .footer-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Header -->
    <header>
        <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-light container-custom">
            <a class="navbar-brand logo" href="#">Jadoo</a>
            <button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#navbarJadoo" aria-controls="navbarJadoo" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Toggle navigation">
                <span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
            </button>
            <div class="collapse navbar-collapse justify-content-end" id="navbarJadoo">
                <ul class="navbar-nav align-items-center gap-lg-4">
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link nav-link-custom" href="#destinos">Destinos</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link nav-link-custom" href="#hoteis">Hotéis</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link nav-link-custom" href="#voos">Voos</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link nav-link-custom" href="#reservas">Reservas</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link nav-link-custom" href="#login">Login</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link btn-signup" href="#inscricao">Inscrever-se</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item">
                        <select class="lang-select ms-lg-2">
                            <option value="PT">PT</option>
                            <option value="EN">EN</option>
                        </select>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="hero container-custom">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <div class="subtitle">Melhores destinos ao redor do mundo</div>
            <h1 class="hero-title">Viaje, aproveite e viva uma nova e plena vida</h1>
            <p class="hero-desc">Viva a experiência das melhores viagens com conforto, planejamento rápido e destinos incríveis preparados sob medida para você.</p>
            <div class="hero-btns">
                <a href="#" class="btn-primary-custom">Saiba mais</a>
                <a href="#" class="play-btn">
                    <div class="play-icon"><i class="fas fa-play"></i></div>
                    <span>Demonstração</span>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-image">
            <img src="Image.png" alt="Mulher viajante">
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Serviços -->
    <section class="categories container-custom section-padding">
        <div class="subtitle">Categoria</div>
        <h2 class="title">Oferecemos os melhores serviços</h2>
        <div class="grid-categories">
            <div class="category-card">
                <div class="category-icon"><img src="Group 48.png" alt="Clima Calculado"></div>
                <h3>Clima Calculado</h3>
                <p>Construído para atender às necessidades de previsão precisa durante suas rotas.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="category-card">
                <div class="category-icon"><img src="Group 51.png" alt="Melhores Voos"></div>
                <h3>Melhores Voos</h3>
                <p>Obtenha os melhores preços e horários adaptados à sua agenda de viagem.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="category-card">
                <div class="category-icon"><img src="Group 50.png" alt="Eventos Locais"></div>
                <h3>Eventos Locais</h3>
                <p>Saiba tudo o que acontece ao seu redor onde quer que você esteja hospedado.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="category-card">
                <div class="category-icon"><img src="Group 49.png" alt="Personalização"></div>
                <h3>Personalização</h3>
                <p>Serviços completamente sob medida para tornar sua experiência inesquecível.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Destinos -->
    <section class="destinations container-custom section-padding" id="destinos">
        <div class="subtitle">Mais vendido</div>
        <h2 class="title">Principais destinos</h2>
        <div class="grid-destinations">
            <div class="dest-card">
                <img src="roma.png" alt="Roma, Itália" class="dest-img">
                <div class="dest-info">
                    <div class="dest-header"><span>Roma, Itália</span><span>R$ 5.420</span></div>
                    <div class="dest-duration"><i class="fas fa-paper-plane"></i><span>Viagem de 10 dias</span></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="dest-card">
                <img src="images.jpg" alt="Londres, Reino Unido" class="dest-img">
                <div class="dest-info">
                    <div class="dest-header"><span>Londres, Reino Unido</span><span>R$ 4.200</span></div>
                    <div class="dest-duration"><i class="fas fa-paper-plane"></i><span>Viagem de 12 dias</span></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="dest-card">
                <img src="Rectangle 14.png" alt="Toda a Europa" class="dest-img">
                <div class="dest-info">
                    <div class="dest-header"><span>Toda a Europa</span><span>R$ 15.000</span></div>
                    <div class="dest-duration"><i class="fas fa-paper-plane"></i><span>Viagem de 28 dias</span></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Reservas -->
    <section class="booking container-custom section-padding" id="reservas">
        <div class="booking-content">
            <div class="subtitle">Fácil e Rápido</div>
            <h2 class="title" style="text-align: left;">Reserve sua próxima viagem em 3 Etapas Fáceis</h2>
            <div class="steps-list">
                <div class="step-item">
                    <img src="Group 7.png" alt="Passo 1" class="step-img">
                    <div class="step-text">
                        <h4>Escolha o Destino</h4>
                        <p>Selecione o local dos seus sonhos entre centenas de opções disponíveis.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="step-item">
                    <img src="Group 12.png" alt="Passo 2" class="step-img">
                    <div class="step-text">
                        <h4>Faça o Pagamento</h4>
                        <p>Processo simples, rápido e 100% seguro com várias opções.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="step-item">
                    <img src="Group 11.png" alt="Passo 3" class="step-img">
                    <div class="step-text">
                        <h4>Chegue ao Aeroporto no Dia Escolhido</h4>
                        <p>Agora é só preparar as malas e aproveitar sua experiência memorável.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="booking-card-wrapper">
            <div class="trip-card">
                <img src="Image-mulher-braços-abertos.png" alt="Viagem para Grécia" class="trip-img">
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Parceiros -->
    <section class="partners container-custom section-padding">
        <div class="partners-logos">
            <img src="parceiros.png" alt="Parceiros Jadoo" class="imagem-parceiros">
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Depoimentos -->
    <section class="testimonials container-custom section-padding">
        <div class="testimonials-content">
            <div class="subtitle">Depoimentos</div>
            <h2 class="title" style="text-align: left; margin-bottom: 0;">O Que As Pessoas Dizem Sobre Nós.</h2>
            <div class="dots-navigation">
                <span class="dot active"></span>
                <span class="dot"></span>
                <span class="dot"></span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="testimonials-card-wrapper">
            <div class="testimonial-card">
                <img src="https://i.pravatar.cc/150?img=11" alt="Mike Taylor" class="testimonial-avatar">
                <p class="testimonial-text">"Na pastagem pintada das janelas, ainda assim suas festas expressas usam. Certamente, por último, ele mesmo sabia o que viria a seguir. Acreditou ou se desviou, não."</p>
                <h4 class="testimonial-author">Mike Taylor</h4>
                <p class="testimonial-location">Lahore, Paquistão</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Inscrição -->
    <section class="subscribe container-custom section-padding" id="inscricao">
        <div class="subscribe-box">
            <h2 class="subscribe-title">Inscreva-se para receber informações, notícias e ofertas interessantes sobre a Jadoo</h2>
            <form class="subscribe-form" id="subscribeForm">
                <div class="input-group-custom">
                    <i class="far fa-envelope"></i>
                    <input type="email" id="subscribeEmail" class="subscribe-input" placeholder="Seu e-mail" required>
                </div>
                <button type="submit" class="subscribe-btn">Inscrever-se</button>
